window.VO = [{"id":"s01","text":"Cyclone Arnab hit Andhra Pradesh near Narsapur, on the twenty-eighth of October.","at":0.6,"t0":0.3,"t1":5.235},{"id":"s02","text":"A year earlier, to the day, Cyclone Montha hit the same coast.","at":11.17,"t0":5.585,"t1":9.09},{"id":"s03","text":"That's not a coincidence. It's a season.","at":19.28,"t0":9.64,"t1":12.095},{"id":"s04","text":"All summer, monsoon winds tear storms apart. In October they drop, over a sea that's still warm.","at":24.89,"t0":12.445,"t1":18.565},{"id":"s05","text":"And at this time of year, the Bay's storms are steered north-west. Straight at this coast.","at":37.93,"t0":18.965,"t1":23.595},{"id":"s06","text":"The Bay of Bengal makes one in twenty of the world's cyclones, but historically, most of the deaths.","at":48.09,"t0":24.045,"t1":29.655},{"id":"s07","text":"Its shallow, funnel-shaped sea piles up surges. In nineteen seventy-seven, a six-metre surge on this coast killed at least ten thousand people.","at":60.31,"t0":30.155,"t1":38.94},{"id":"s08","text":"Arnab was a very severe cyclone. But this time, over fifty thousand people were moved before it hit.","at":79.68,"t0":39.84,"t1":46.33},{"id":"s09","text":"The root cause of the difference? Not weaker storms. Warnings days ahead, and shelters built after that storm.","at":93.66,"t0":46.83,"t1":53.515},{"id":"s10","text":"Next October, the Bay will be warm again.","at":108.03,"t0":54.015,"t1":56.565}];
